  <!-- Location selection -->
  <Fragment slot="location">
    <p>In alignment with recommendations made in the Final Report, Grande-Comores and Anjouan islands have been identified as priority intervention areas. Specifically, the districts of Moroni-Bambao, Hambou and Mitsamiouli-Mboudé in Grande-Comores, and the district of Sima in Anjouan, have been identified as areas of concern. Additional areas and specific locations of intervention are to be agreed between the Government of Comoros, the EU Office in Comoros, and IOM.</p>
  </Fragment>

